    SPAddressFormatTypeSchema = external_exports.enum(["DEFAULT", "US", "IN", "UK"]).describe("A named address FORMAT standard \u2014 how the address lines are LABELLED and validated for a locale (field labels, placeholders, whether state / postal code are required, postal-code pattern). This is a PRESENTATION concern, never stored on an `SPAddress`; the concrete definitions and the country \u2192 format mapping live in `support-ts` (see `prepareAddressFormat`). The type is shared here so both FE and BE can name a format. `DEFAULT` is the neutral international layout that renders correctly for most countries.");
